  "name": "admin-websocket",
  "description": "Remote administration over TLS, using native envelopes or WebSocket binary messages as named by the transcript (DEVICE-EXCHANGE 1.4, REMOTE-ADMIN.md). Administration is off by default: admin-auth is answered admin-disabled. When turned on, clients outside allowedAddresses are closed without answer. A wrong password is bad-credentials; rapid attempts from the same client address are rate-limited by the per-address pacer; when the password verifier is saturated the answer is capacity. An authenticated session token expires after the configured lifetime (default 15 minutes) or stream close. Carries 18 operations and never host OS settings.",
